        "title": "Spartamax™ – Natural Male Vitality & Performance Boost",
        "meta_descr": "Spartamax™ is a modern male wellness gummy created to help support stamina, confidence, and daily performance. Inspired by the legendary strength and vitality of ancient Spartan warriors, Spartamax combines time-tested natural ingredients with modern nutritional science.",
        "header_custom": "<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"prosta defend, prostadefend, prosta defend supplement, prosta defend pills\">\n <meta name=\"author\" content=\"prosta defend\">\n\t\t\n <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"\" >",
