          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features9\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/html\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"3\" max=\"7\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Price\" name=\"showPrice\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparentCard\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"cardsBg\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"!transparentCard\">\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>4</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#fafafa\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#bed3f9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid' : fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"item features-image\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <a href=\"https://a6a76ccp33x-i18ap1xhuxxm8g.hop.clickbank.net\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/ebook-blueprint.webp\" alt=\"AlphaFuel Pro \"></a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <div class=\"row\">\n                                <div class=\"col-md\">\n                                    <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>BONUS #1</b><br><b>Spartan Surge Blueprint</b><b><br></b><b style=\"font-size: 1.6rem;\">* Digital Program</b><br><b style=\"font-size: 1.6rem;\"><br></b></h6>\n                                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\"><b>Today: FREE\n</b><br>Your step-by-step guide to getting the most out of Spartamax. Inside, you'll discover dozens of simple tips, powerful secrets, foods, nutrients and smoothie recipes designed to complement Spartamax and support libido and performance — including the “alpha mineral” that 92% of men may be missing, a forbidden-fruit smoothie combination for male vitality, and much more.<br></p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"col-md-auto\" mbr-if=\"showPrice || showButtons\">\n                                    <p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\" data-app-selector=\".price\">$29</p>\n                                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                            Buy Now\n                                        </a></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-2 d-none d-lg-block' : fullWidth}\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <a href=\"https://a6a76ccp33x-i18ap1xhuxxm8g.hop.clickbank.net\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/ebook-domsxpwr.webp\" alt=\"AlphaFuel Pro \"></a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <div class=\"row\">\n                                <div class=\"col-md\">\n                                    <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>BONUS #2</b><br><div><br></div><div><b>Dominant Sexual Power\n</b></div><div><b>* Digital Program</b></div></h6>\n                                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\"><br><b>Today: FREE\n</b><br>A complete masterclass packed with tips, techniques and little-known secrets from legendary lovers and modern sexual performance experts. Discover how to build unshakable bedroom confidence, dramatically improve your stamina, better understand what drives female pleasure, and master the techniques that make you the kind of lover she fantasizes about.<br></p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"col-md-auto\" mbr-if=\"showPrice || showButtons\">\n                                    <p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\" data-app-selector=\".price\">$29</p>\n                                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                            Buy Now\n                                        </a>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-2 d-none d-lg-block' : fullWidth}\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</section>",
